MACRO
    - macro needs namings: who uses this codes need to name it (annoying for nested structures but feasible)
    - what is very critical: if you implement PUSH/POP, you will need to implement it for EACH structure or 
        use another macro to define Q operations. Works but tedious since you have to implement in a macro 
        what you typically implement in C code. Debug sucks.

POINTERS
    - u define structures then use it. possibly bad behaviour with pointers